 it till it\'s gone away<br/>Till it\'s gone away<br/>Till it\'s gone away<br/><br/>It\'s in his nature, his misbehaviour, and misdemeanours<br/>The boy ain\'t no genius, he keeps her on her toes<br/>It\'s in his nature, his misbehaviour, and misdemeanours<br/>The boy ain\'t no genius, he keeps her on her toes<br/>It\'s in his nature, his misbehaviour, and misdemeanours<br/>The boy ain\'t no genius, he keeps her on her toes<br/>It\'s in his nature, his misbehaviour, and misdemeanours<br/>The boy ain\'t no genius, he keeps her on her toes<br/>On her toes<br/>Said the boy ain\'t no genius but he keeps her on her toes<br/><br/>Two lovers stop for kisses on a wall<br/>She asked him, \"Never leave me\"<br/>He tells her that he won\'t<br/></div>','lol, this is so easy','','publish','open','open','','lol-this-is-so-easy','','','2008-01-26 03:58:00','2008-01-26 03:58:00','',0,'http://blog.grillermo.com/?p=787',0,'post','',0),(788,1,'2008-01-25 05:06:00','2008-01-25 05:06:00',':(<br /><p>ke triste hace mucho no sueño nada :( </p>','','','publish','open','open','','788','','','2008-01-25 05:06:00','2008-01-25 05:06:00','',0,'http://blog.grillermo.com/?p=788',0,'post','',2),(789,1,'2008-01-23 21:23:00','2008-01-23 21:23:00','<div xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\'>Sum more indie luv. :)<br /><object height=\'355\' width=\'425\'><param value=\'http://www.youtube.com/v/onyNWvORuco&amp;rel=1\' name=\'movie\'/><param value=\'transparent\' name=\'wmode\'/><embed height=\'355\' width=\'425\' wmode=\'transparent\' type=\'application/x-shockwave-flash\' src=\'http://www.youtube.com/v/onyNWvORuco&amp;rel=1\'/></object></div>','Figurines - Hey Girl','','publish','open','open','','figurines-hey-girl','','','2008-01-23 21:23:00','2008-01-23 21:23:00','',0,'http://blog.grillermo.com/?p=789',0,'post','',0),(790,1,'2008-01-22 22:11:00','2008-01-22 22:11:00','<div xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\'>Mis superpoderes me traicionan, estoy teniendo ataques de ansia en momentos aleatorios del día. De los que solía tener en situaciones, mas ... familiares.<br />¿Que pasa alguien conoce a algun buen charlatan que me pueda explicar esto?</div>','Ok, el voodoo puede que funcione.','','publish','open','open','','ok-el-voodoo-puede-que-funcione','','','2008-01-22 22:11:00','2008-01-22 22:11:00','',0,'http://blog.grillermo.com/?p=790',0,'post','',0),(791,1,'2008-01-16 03:34:00','2008-01-16 03:34:00','<div xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\'>Lolerskatez lets roll.<br /><br /><img src=\"http://imgred.com/tn/http://www.savagechickens.com/images/chickenprank.jpg\" /></div>','lawl my gawd','','publish','open','open','','lawl-my-gawd','','','2008-01-16 03:34:00','2008-01-16 03:34:00','',0,'http://blog.grillermo.com/?p=791',0,'post','',0),(792,1,'2008-01-16 03:08:00','2008-01-16 03:08:00','<div xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\'>Es fuera de mis tradiciones blogeadiles postear links a videos en vez de encamarlos aca.Pero esta vieja hace que mis organos internos bailen con mi corazón.<br/>Ida Maria - \"to her music intro\"<br/>http://utrecht.cc/artist/Ida%20Maria/v/194778<br/>Ya necesitaba sustituta de mi cantanta favorita.<br/></div>','Ida Maria','','publish','open','open','','ida-maria','','','2008-01-16 03:08:00','2008-01-16 03:08:00','',0,'http://blog.grillermo.com/?p=792',0,'post','',0),(793,1,'2008-01-14 05:34:00','2008-01-14 05:34:00','Este video esta mpr, muy pinche raro, y de kch, ke chingaos?, y de odnm, oh dios no mames, es como todas esas obras de teatro que no me gusta ir a ver, y esas peliculas de arte contemporaneo que odio porque soy un naco inculto.<br /><object width=\"425\" height=\"355\"><param name=\"movie\" value=\"http://www.youtube.com/v/D-T-5LJ9KIg&rel=1\"></param><param name=\"wmode\" value=\"transparent\"></param><embed src=\"http://www.youtube.com/v/D-T-5LJ9KIg&rel=1\" type=\"application/x-shockwave-flash\" wmode=\"transparent\" width=\"425\" height=\"355\"></embed></object><br />Pero me encanta la canción jejeje<br /><br />I\'m in a crisis, I need help<br />Come on mood shift,<br />Shift back to good again<br />Come on mood shift,<br />Shift back to good again<br />Come on, be a friend<br /><br />Nina Twin is trying to help, and I<br />Really hope that she succeeds<br />Though I picked<br />The thorny path myself<br />I\'m afraid, afraid of where it leads<br /><br />Chemicals<br />Don\'t strangle my pen<br />Chemicals<br />Don\'t make me sick again<br />I\'m always so dubious of your intent<br />Like I can\'t afford to replace<br />What you\'ve spent<br /><br />Come on, chemicals!<br />Come on, chemicals!<br />Come on, chemicals!<br /><br />Nina Twin is trying to help, and I<br />Really hope she gets me straight<br />\'Cause my own inner cosmology<br />Has become too dense to navigate<br /><br />Oh oh oh oh oh oh oh<br />[Heimdalsgate Like A Promethean Curse lyrics on http://www.metrolyrics.com]<br /><br /><br />I\'m in a crisis, I need help<br />Come on mood shift,<br />Shift back to good again<br />Come on mood shift,<br />Shift back to good again<br />Come on, be a friend<br />Come on, be a friend<br /><br />2, 3, 4<br /><br />Chemicals<br />Don\'t flatten my mind<br />Chemicals<br />Don\'t mess me up this time<br />Know you bait me<br />Way more than you should<br />And it\'s just like you to hurt me when I\'m feeling good<br /><br />Come on, chemicals!<br />Come on, chemicals!<br />Come on, chemicals!<br />Come on, chemicals!<br />Come on, chemicals!<br />Come on, chemicals!<br />Come on, chemicals!<br />Come on, chemicals!<br />Come on, chemicals!<br />Come on, chemicals!<br />Come on, chemicals!<br /></div></div>','Heimdalsgate Like a Promethean Curse - Of Montreal','','publish','open','open','','heimdalsgate-like-a-promethean-curse-of-montreal','','','2008-01-14 05:34:00','2008-01-14 05:34:00','',0,'http://blog.grillermo.com/?p=793',0,'post','',0),(794,1,'2008-01-13 04:21:00','2008-01-13 04:21:00','<div xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\'>Cada acto de creación es primero un acto de destrucción. <b>- Pablo Picasso</b><br/><br/>Este sujeto me gusta mas como artista de la vida que de la pintura, mi maestro de filosofía y poética solía decirnos, no intenten ser poetas en el papel, intenten serlo en su vida. Nunca entendí que quiso decir.<br/></div>','Supositorio de sabiduria','','publish','open','open','','supositorio-de-sabiduria','','','2008-01-13 04:21:00','2008-01-13 04:21:00','',0,'http://blog.grillermo.com/?p=794',0,'post','',0),(795,1,'2008-01-10 04:23:00','2008-01-10 04:23:00','<div xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\'>Este wuey se vio habil en su venganza contra su novia que le puso el cuerno.<br/> <a href=\"http://en.thisbitch.info/?id=954c5ea5818eea9e1d780222f9c7c98c\">http://en.thisbitch.info/?id=954c5ea5818eea9e1d780222f9c7c98c</a><br/>Chequen la historia, es un genio<br/></div>','venganza de poder','','publish','open','open','','venganza-de-poder','','','2008-01-10 04:23:00','2008-01-10 04:23:00','',0,'http://blog.grillermo.com/?p=795',0,'post','',1),(796,1,'2008-01-08 07:26:00','2008-01-08 07:26:00','<div xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\'>La vida virtual de un administrador de un famoso buscador de torrentes fue hackeada, los comentarios de los hackers me encantaron<br/>They discovered the admin’s real name, address, age and even the car he drives. After having fun making a mess of the account, the hackers said: “At this point we just deleted his account, because maximum lulz were achieved.”<br/>Hhahahahahaha necesito encontrar algún punto en mi vida donde esa frase quede.<br/><br/>-Guillermo, porque incendiaste mi casa y luego entraste corriendo a salvar una caja de galletas olvidando a mi abuela?<br/>-Man... what else could i have done, gratuitous amounts of lulz needed to be achieved.<br/></div>','Casos de la vida real','','publish','open','open','','casos-de-la-vida-real','','','2008-01-08 07:26:00','2008-01-08 07:26:00','',0,'http://blog.grillermo.com/?p=796',0,'post','',0),(797,1,'2008-01-08 06:14:00','2008-01-08 06:1