sin embargo me encuentro ante una paradoja de respuesta.<br /><br />Hace mucho que no tenía un período de tranquilidad y paz para ser yo mismo, sin padres o equis cosa presionando, la paradoja reside en eso, el que no pase nada no puede ser causa de algo','','','draft','open','open','','','','','2007-10-31 04:20:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'http://blog.grillermo.com/?p=834',0,'post','',0),(835,1,'2007-10-30 04:10:00','2007-10-30 04:10:00','Yajuuuuu ya soy un miembro productivo de la comunidad linux, acabo de traducir(al ingles) y modificar mi mejorar mi primer script para bash. Sin mencionar a los muchos noobs <a href=\"http://ubuntuforums.org/search.php?searchid=30179020\">que he ayudado en los foros</a>.<br />Y solo para el placer de la araña de google pondré aquí la descripción.<br /><br /><span style=\"font-size:130%;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(204, 0, 0);\">Amsn 0.97rc1 easy installation script</span>, antialising, winks, webcam support, drawing support, desktop integration(chameleon and DI plugins) for gnome or kde, 32 bits version, in all the available languages(english, spanish included).</span></span><br />This script fetches the tarballs(from sourceforge and the tcltls project ftp) with the source code needed to compile the latest unstable version of amsn for linux(not cvs), it should work in other debian based distros.<br /><br /><a href=\"http://ubuntuforums.org/showthread.php?t=595744\">Visit the ubuntu forums to <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Get it</span></a><br /><br />Dependencies(the script solves them in debian based):<br /><ul><li>build-essential</li><li>libc6-dev</li><li>libx11-dev</li><li>libxft-dev</li><li>imagemagick</li><li>fakeroot</li><li>libpng12-dev</li><li>libjpeg-dev</li><li>dh-buildinfo</li><li>zenity</li><li>unzip</li></ul>Author:                  C. Estrella/warc3r at gmail dot com<br />Translator,CoDev: me<br /><br /><a href=\"http://ubuntuforums.org/showthread.php?t=595744\">Visit the ubuntu forums to <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Get it</span></a><br /><br />Screenies<br /><br /><a href=\"http://photobucket.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"http://i15.photobucket.com/albums/a363/gsiliceo/Pantallazo-1.png\" alt=\"Photo Sharing and Video Hosting at Photobucket\" border=\"0\" /></a><br /><br /><a href=\"http://photobucket.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"http://i15.photobucket.com/albums/a363/gsiliceo/Pantallazo.png\" alt=\"Photo Sharing and Video Hosting at Photobucket\" border=\"0\" /></a>','Geeky post','','publish','open','open','','geeky-post','','','2007-10-30 04:10:00','2007-10-30 04:10:00','',0,'http://blog.grillermo.com/?p=835',0,'post','',1),(836,1,'2007-10-30 04:04:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','Yeiiii! soy un miembro productivo de la comunidad ubuntu, acabo de traducir y mejorar mi primer script.<br />Y solo para la araña de google pondré la descripción aca:<br /><br />Script instalador de aMSN 0.97RC1 para ubuntu gutsy, incluye antialising para fuentes hermosamente renderizada','','','draft','open','open','','','','','2007-10-30 04:04:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'http://blog.grillermo.com/?p=836',0,'post','',0),(837,1,'2007-10-29 03:10:00','2007-10-29 03:10:00','<object height=\"355\" width=\"425\"><param name=\"movie\" value=\"http://www.youtube.com/v/SOPiOe9dezQ\"><param name=\"wmode\" value=\"transparent\"><embed src=\"http://www.youtube.com/v/SOPiOe9dezQ\" type=\"application/x-shockwave-flash\" wmode=\"transparent\" height=\"355\" width=\"425\"></embed></object><br /><br />Yeah I feel better today,<br />I think that it was just a phase,<br />My whole outlook\'s changed,<br />I\'ve even stopped feelin\' strange.<br />I can understand why you was mad now,<br />Why should you be the one who has to lose out,<br />just cuz I\'m on one?<br />I said \"I\'m always gonna have things going on!\"<br /><br />I feel so much better today,<br />chase the bad things away.<br /><br />I was