itnessing my head spin senseless\nin a <span title=\"\">whisper</span> teasing my inner sadness\n<span title=\"\">\nAnd i</span> have constructed\nmerribly have <span title=\"\">established</span>\nto conserve this madness\nthat falters what i have gather\nhalf destroyed <span title=\"The simple past form of &lt;i&gt;tear&lt;/i&gt; is &lt;i&gt;t&lt;b&gt;ore&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;. After forms of &lt;i&gt;have&lt;/i&gt; and &lt;i&gt;be&lt;/i&gt;, write &lt;i&gt;tor&lt;b&gt;n&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;.\">half bathered</span>\nwith a timeless sense instructed\nto be righted in this <span title=\"If you are indicating possession, write &lt;i&gt;its&lt;/i&gt; without an apostrophe, e.g.: &lt;i&gt;the weather follows &lt;b&gt;its&lt;/b&gt; own schedule&lt;/i&gt; (&lt;i&gt;it\'s&lt;/i&gt; stands for &quot;it is&quot; or &quot;it has&quot;).\">moment</span> swiftly passed','Fornoia','','inherit','closed','closed','','6-revision-v1','','','2020-05-18 09:11:37','2020-05-18 15:11:37','',6,'https://blog.grillermo.com/?p=1172',0,'revision','',0),(1174,1,'2020-05-27 21:50:09','2020-05-28 03:50:09','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Corrí a meterme a un candado de oro amarrado<br>me hizo la vida fácil su sombra dulcemente enmarcada<br>quería que me sirviera como no sirven los candados<br>como fogata azuzada a cobijazos <br>como arete en la pata de una paloma <br>oculto gritándole sus verdades a la nada<br>a quién espero tenga la llave y diga hola<br><br>Tras jeroglíficos vea la piramide que largo he armado<br>de palitos regados con aire y sueños ahogados<br>pero lindos, eso si, <br>pero pulcros de sus intenciones, eso si<br>pero sin mentiras también<br>que la mentiras y lo que no se dice son comparsas<br>parte del repertorio olvidado tras bambalinas<br>bambalinas para mi<br>bambalinas de mis entrañas<br>en este teatro apretado, forzado, amagado<br>se hace de nuevo lo que ya estaba agotado <br>y vuelve a la vida</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Mas ocultaciones','','publish','open','open','','mas-ocultaciones','','','2020-06-01 19:42:50','2020-06-02 01:42:50','',0,'http://blog.grillermo.com/?p=1174',0,'post','',0),(1175,1,'2020-05-27 21:50:09','2020-05-28 03:50:09','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yo corrí a meterme a un candado de oro amarrado<br>me hizo la vida fácil su sombra dulcemente enmarcada<br>quería que me sirviera como no sirven los candados<br>como fogata azuzada a cobijazos <br>como arete en la pata de una paloma <br>oculto gritándole sus verdades a la nada<br>a quién espero tenga la llave y diga hola<br><br>Tras jeroglíficos vea la piramide que largo he armado<br>de palitos regados con aire y sueños ahogados<br>pero lindos eso si, pero pulcros de sus intenciones<br>pero sin mentiras<br>que la mentiras y lo que no se dice no son parientes<br>son parte del repertorio olvidado tras bambalinas<br>bambalinas para mi<br>bambalinas de mis entrañas<br>en este teatro apretado, forzado, amagado<br>se hace de nuevo lo que ya estaba agotado </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Mas ocultaciones','','inherit','closed','closed','','1174-revision-v1','','','2020-05-27 21:50:09','2020-05-28 03:50:09','',1174,'https://blog.grillermo.com/?p=1175',0,'revision','',0),(1177,1,'2020-05-27 22:06:56','2020-05-28 04:06:56','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I\'m an expert in so little. I\'m just an expert on my self. I am not an expert on everything like everybody else is these days. I even decided to lose expertice on opinions, too little effort too little reward, no value. So i decided to keep my self small, to grow if need be when need be for the moment that\'s needed and that\'s it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><br>They tell me that with this attitude, without selling expertice i would not build a career and i would be nothing. They told me that people, in this era, is what they work on. That money for rich people is the proof that they are. So in their lust to be they make money and making more money makes them more of them selves. Like fixing more shoes makes more of the shoe repair man, like that you are more successful, happier if you do more of your job like nobody else, that the ultimate success is fill the world of you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><br>I wonder if by being so little i\'ll be more. This is my thing! being so few of me becomes my beingness so the less i am the more the world is full of me.<br>I guess being so far away in their islands makes people vanish and the world empty. The months turn people in a poof of nothigness and writing might, just might, provide sustance to my self, reinflate me words!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Quarantine makes you ghost-like','','publish','open','open','','quarantine-makes-you-ghost-like','','','2020-10-07 22:14:27','2020-10-08 04:14:27','',0,'http://blog.grillermo.com/?p=1177',0,'post','',0),(1178,1,'2020-05-27 22:06:56','2020-05-28 04:06:56','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I\'m an expert in so little. I\'m just an expert on my self. I am not an expert on everything like everybody else is these days. I even decided to lose expertice on opinions, too little effort too little reward, no value. So i decided to keep my self small, to grow if need be when need be for the moment that\'s needed and that\'s it.<br>They tell me that with this attitude, without selling expertice i would not build a career and i would be nothing. They told me that people in this era are what they work on. That money for rich people is the proof that they are. So in their lust to be they make money and making more money makes them more of them selves. Like taking fixing more shoes makes more of the shoe repair man, like that you are more successful, happier if you do more of your job like nobody else, that the ultimate success is fill the world of you.<br>I wonder if by being so little i\'ll be more. This is my thing! being so few of me becomes my beingness so the less i am the more the world is full of me.<br>I guess being so far in this island makes people vanish and t